    <Phrase Key="Title" Text="TreeView — a real file system"/>
    <Phrase Key="Hint" Text="Pointed at a drive and built lazily: each folder reads its contents only when you expand it (a folder like System32 has thousands of siblings — a stress test for the coming virtualization). Double-click a folder to expand/collapse; pick the drive and selection mode below."/>
